ORDERS ["Take Pan Like a Legend now.","Defend the claim through wave 10; prioritize enemies closest to the works, especially wreckers and thieves.","During wave 8, engage the 8 surviving enemies from the south while staying near the claim and existing turrets.","Use the rig blast whenever ready against the densest enemy cluster threatening the works.","Before wave 9, hold near the center ford at the claim and let both turrets maintain line of sight.","Save gold until 50g, then build turret index 2 at (0,6); if that position is invalid, place it at (-6,12).","After the third turret, spend 10g palisades to block the most exposed approach without obstructing turret fire.","Do not pan distant seams during active waves; survival through wave 10 takes priority over gold.","After wave 10 is secured, remain for the Rush only while hero HP is at least 60 and works HP is at least 160; otherwise extract."]
